    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d37">

                <pb facs="0178" n="60" xml:id="pg60"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adams to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio
                                de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-11-17"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 17,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Imperial family sailed to-day. Government <hi rendition="#italic">de facto</hi>,
                    with ministry, established. Perfect order maintained. Important we acknowledge
                    Republic first.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adams.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
